OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with attempted murder
OL,4,Aafter stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with attempted
OL,7,Fmurder following a stabbing incident in
OL,8,FBorough Green in which three people
OL,9,Fwere injured.
OL,11,FKent Police said armed officers were
OL,12,Fcalled to a property in Sevenoaks Road,
OL,13,Fat about 07:40 BST on Thursday.
OL,15,FTwo men suffered injuries consistent
OL,16,Fwith stab wounds, and a woman sustained
OL,17,Finjuries to her arm and face. One of
OL,18,Fthe men's injuries was potentially
OL,19,Flife-changing, Kent Police said.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
