OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with attempted murder
OL,4,Aafter stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FJuan Martez-Ortiz has been charged with
OL,7,Fattempted murder, two counts of causing
OL,8,Fgrievous bodily harm with intent,
OL,9,Fpossession of a knife, aggravated
OL,10,Fburglary and stalking, the force said.
